  --clone 6oCkp6gpyjxVTeL6ahMYcekN2x2pzt1KY8g2LqemaTNE \
  `# ── the swap venue ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────` \
  `# Buyers pay USDC and the coin launches on a SOL curve, so the raise is swapped through` \
  `# Raydium AMM v4 at the close. Without these the swap cannot be exercised at all, and` \
  `# neither can crediting: a buy is QUOTED at this pool's spot, so credit reads it too.` \
